rification that the source metadata has not been altered.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Strong attestation:<\/strong> Source information is provided, and the provenance metadata has been cryptographically verified to provides evidence that the metadata has not been modified since it was recorded.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\nThese descriptions refer only to information about the provenance of the answer and do not imply that an answer is necessarily correct or incorrect. Please consider each answer independently.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Instructions","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this study, you'll see a series of answers generated by an AI system in response to everyday q...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID2"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_a4OfOHYGYZU4bbg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID20","SecondaryAttribute":"If you acted on this answer and it turned out to be wrong, how serious would the outcome be?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"If you acted on this answer and it turned out to be wrong, how serious would the outcome be?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Consiquence","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"If you acted on this answer and it turned out to be wrong, how serious would the outcome be?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1 (Not serious at all)"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5 (Extremely serious)"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID20"}},{"